What is the Doge Life token?

DogeLife is a Web3 ecosystem project built on Dogecoin's global community, with interstellar civilization at the heart of its narrative. Its token serves as ecosystem fuel, using on-chain rewards without staking or lockups alongside deflationary token burns. The project is progressively building Swap, the DL (U Card) identity system, Space Ticket NFTs, games, and more, with the ultimate goal of community-led DAO governance.
